9c93-468e-b8e5-771296b74fb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4afbb007aa2ab40affcb21931a325f7b, https://si.imgix.net/7744212c/uploads/origins/0e80af2e-9c93-468e-b8e5-771296b74fb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de023027d49e2e95b1e7b595c43ac6ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7744212c/uploads/origins/0e80af2e-9c93-468e-b8e5-771296b74fb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b106e5cb9b1dd7d3cc51c25bc8521a2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nIt is me again! I wanted to ask for another commission of my assassin couple who live in Italy and work for a crime organization.\n\nHere a recap of their personalities once again:\n\n[カプチーノ]:\n\n29 years old. 166cm tall with shoes. She is an adult, mature woman with a curvy and muscular build. Quiet and calm personality wise, has weird mannerisms and can be very eccentric. Generally she appears as quite creepy and ominous by people who don’t know her. She is usually more outgoing and lighthearted in private and especially when she is together with her lover [リゾット]\n\n[リゾット]:\n\n28 years old. 195cm tall with a very muscular build. He is the leader of the hitman team. Very serious and stoic personality wise. A very intimidating, analytical and smart person who always gets his assassinations done perfectly. With [カプチーノ] he is more relaxed , attentive and very protective, attentive and gentle with her.\n\nFor this commission I leave the freedom of creativity up to you! It can be something romantic like a cute interaction or also something more serious like a scene from their job or just them enjoying quiet time together. I would be very happy it you include a fitting background again, I loved the background you did draw last time. \n\nThank you so much in advance!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-A7BYIsRbqNhiC5wwOY5Vr7aJ__JFEfQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@viajunk/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/086149e5/uploads/origins/99856ba7-8480-4c73-ae61-fc42b1d3c876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ea7de00248f25fcf3450f21d03aa28a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/086149e5/uploads/origins/99856ba7-8480-4c73-ae61-fc42b1d3c876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ea7de00248f25fcf3450f21d03aa28a, https://si.imgix.net/086149e5/uploads/origins/99856ba7-8480-4c73-ae61-fc42b1d3c876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=408418e8c62813718b8fb02294e01269 2x, https://si.imgix.net/086149e5/uploads/origins/99856ba7-8480-4c73-ae61-fc42b1d3c876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59c6d0dead354cfcbb2d00a16fe85fa1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nとても素敵な作品を拝見させていただきました。リクエスト失礼いたします...！\nもし可能であれば、この子を描いて頂きませんか？\n\n彼女は天真爛漫な女の子、森に住む魔法使いです。\n外見は獣人種だが、実は魔法から生まれた妖精。森の動物たちと仲良し、いつもリスや小鳥に囲まれてる感じ。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10B7r6tvSAbNk9-j35H6cgDfbdfefE_EQ?usp=sharing\n構図、衣装などは一切おまかせいたします。uni様のセンスに自由に描いていただけましたら幸いです...！\n\n↓こちらのイラストの雰囲気が特にすきなのでこんな感じで描いていただけるとうれしいです！\nhttps://skeb.jp/@viajunk/works/7\nもし条件等難しい場合は遠慮なくキャンセルしていただいて大丈夫です...！\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@viajunk/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b93954a/uploads/origins/c6e0498b-4fc7-4c9c-8dd0-2609e9dc5cd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28b66a6ee1c9f817ef5790857098f512", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b93954a/uploads/origins/c6e0498b-4fc7-4c9c-8dd0-2609e9dc5cd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28b66a6ee1c9f817ef5790857098f512, https://si.imgix.net/8b93954a/uploads/origins/c6e0498b-4fc7-4c9c-8dd0-2609e9dc5cd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92c8d94b42ad927e9e9d54d0d597407